      "content": "honestly, words don't really help at this point. when i look at the numbers and then look at my kids, it just feels like a loop of misery that never stops. everything i touch breaks. it feels less like a \"situation\" and more like a fundamental truth about me. if there's literally no way to fix the damage, then why am i even dragging this out? it just feels like i'm making everyone watch me fail in slow motion.",
